!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1	"Samples are processed in parallel in 96-well plates to minimize potential variation. Reaction purification is achieved using magnetic binding beads for cDNA and Qiagen RNeasy kits for cRNA purification. Isolated total RNA samples were assayed for quality (Agilent Bioanalyzer) and yield (Ribogreen) metrics prior to amplification."	"Samples are processed in parallel in 96-well plates to minimize potential variation. Reaction purification is achieved using magnetic binding beads for cDNA and Qiagen RNeasy kits for cRNA purification. Isolated total RNA samples were assayed for quality (Agilent Bioanalyzer) and yield (Ribogreen) metrics prior to amplification."	"Samples are processed in parallel in 96-well plates to minimize potential variation. Reaction purification is achieved using magnetic binding beads for cDNA and Qiagen RNeasy kits for cRNA purification. Isolated total RNA samples were assayed for quality (Agilent Bioanalyzer) and yield (Ribogreen) metrics prior to amplification."	"Samples are processed in parallel in 96-well plates to minimize potential variation. Reaction purification is achieved using magnetic binding beads for cDNA and Qiagen RNeasy kits for cRNA purification. Isolated total RNA samples were assayed for quality (Agilent Bioanalyzer) and yield (Ribogreen) metrics prior to amplification."	"Samples are processed in parallel in 96-well plates to minimize potential variation. Reaction purification is achieved using magnetic binding beads for cDNA and Qiagen RNeasy kits for cRNA purification. Isolated total RNA samples were assayed for quality (Agilent Bioanalyzer) and yield (Ribogreen) metrics prior to amplification."	"Samples are processed in parallel in 96-well plates to minimize potential variation. Reaction purification is achieved using magnetic binding beads for cDNA and Qiagen RNeasy kits for cRNA purification. Isolated total RNA samples were assayed for quality (Agilent Bioanalyzer) and yield (Ribogreen) metric